---
import ResponsiveImage from "../ResponsiveImage.astro";
---
<section class="ed-section ed-portrait" id="portrait">
  <div class="ed-container ed-feature">
    <figure class="ed-feature-image">
      <ResponsiveImage src="/assets/detail-portrait.jpg" alt="柔和蓝色墙面上，装裱的宠物艺术肖像" width={1600} height={1200} sizes="(max-width: 767px) 90vw, 52vw" />
      <figcaption>PORTRAIT OF A LITTLE SOUL / AI 艺术肖像</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="ed-feature-copy">
      <p class="ed-kicker">02 / MY OTHER LITTLE WORLDS</p>
      <h2>换一个世界，<br />还是你爱的我。</h2>
      <p>是画里的小小缪斯，是封面上的闪耀主角，<br class="ed-desktop-break" />也可以是梦里跑出来的奇妙伙伴。</p>
      <p>选一幅心动的画面，上传我的照片。<br />让熟悉的小表情，遇见新的想象。</p>
      <a class="ed-button ed-button-light" href="#works">替我选一个新模样 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <p class="ed-fineprint">以下为 AI 创意示例。实际模板与生成效果以小程序内展示为准。</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
